#: languages privacy licenses
msgid "Swajp – keyboard for Android"
msgstr "Swajp – tastatura za Android"

#: privacy
msgid "Swajp – Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Swajp – Politika privatnosti"

#: privacy
msgid "Effective 21 November 2026"
msgstr "Važi od 21. novembra 2026."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Swajp is an Android keyboard designed so that no data leaves your phone."
msgstr ""
"Swajp je tastatura za Android osmišljena tako da nikakvi podaci ne napuštaju tvoj telefon."

#: privacy
msgid "Internet access"
msgstr "Pristup internetu"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"The app does not have the internet permission, so it cannot send anything you type or say. It contains no ads, analytics or trackers."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija nema dozvolu za internet, pa ne može da pošalje ništa što otkucaš ili izgovoriš. Ne sadrži reklame, analitiku ni alatke za praćenje."

#: privacy
msgid "What is stored and where"
msgstr "Šta se čuva i gde"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Learned words, word pairs and swipe traces</b> are stored only in the app's private storage on your phone to improve suggestions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Naučene reči, parovi reči i tragovi prevlačenja</b> čuvaju se samo u privatnom skladištu aplikacije na tvom telefonu, radi boljih predloga."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Clipboard history</b> (if enabled) stays on the phone and is deleted automatically after the chosen time. Text from password fields, text marked sensitive by the system and text that looks like a password or code is never stored."
msgstr ""
"<b>Istorija privremene memorije</b> (ako je uključena) ostaje na telefonu i automatski se briše posle izabranog vremena. Tekst iz polja za lozinke, tekst koji sistem označi kao osetljiv i tekst koji izgleda kao lozinka ili kôd nikad se ne čuvaju."

#: privacy
msgid "<b>Settings</b> stay on the phone."
msgstr "<b>Podešavanja</b> ostaju na telefonu."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Nothing is learned or stored in password fields or in apps that request incognito mode."
msgstr ""
"U poljima za lozinke i u aplikacijama koje traže anonimni režim ništa se ne uči niti čuva."

#: privacy
msgid "Microphone and voice input"
msgstr "Mikrofon i glasovni unos"

#: privacy
msgid "The microphone is used only when you start voice input."
msgstr "Mikrofon se koristi samo kad pokreneš glasovni unos."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Offline models</b> (Parakeet, Omnilingual) convert speech to text on the phone. Audio is not sent anywhere and is not kept."
msgstr ""
"<b>Oflajn modeli</b> (Parakeet, Omnilingual) pretvaraju govor u tekst na samom telefonu. Snimak se nikuda ne šalje i ne čuva se."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Google recognition</b> (if you choose it) uses the Android system speech recognition service; Google processes the audio under its own policy: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">policies.google.com/privacy</a>. Swajp itself sends nothing."
msgstr ""
"<b>Google prepoznavanje</b> (ako ga izabereš) koristi sistemsku uslugu prepoznavanja govora u Androidu; Google obrađuje snimak prema sopstvenim pravilima: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">policies.google.com/privacy</a>. Swajp sam ništa ne šalje."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"You download voice models yourself in your browser; the app does not need the internet for that."
msgstr ""
"Glasovne modele preuzimaš sam u pregledaču; aplikaciji za to nije potreban internet."

#: privacy
msgid "Export and import"
msgstr "Izvoz i uvoz"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"A backup is created only on your request, into a file you choose. It is never sent automatically."
msgstr ""
"Rezervna kopija se pravi samo na tvoj zahtev, u datoteku koju izabereš. Nikad se ne šalje automatski."

#: privacy
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr "Deljenje"

#: privacy
msgid "Swajp does not sell, share or transfer any data to third parties."
msgstr ""
"Swajp ne prodaje, ne deli niti prenosi nikakve podatke trećim stranama."

#: privacy
msgid "Deleting data"
msgstr "Brisanje podataka"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Delete learned data in settings (Learning → “Smazat vše naučené”) or uninstall the app to remove everything."
msgstr ""
"Izbriši naučene podatke u podešavanjima (Reči i učenje → „Izbriši sve naučeno“) ili deinstaliraj aplikaciju da ukloniš sve."

#: privacy
msgid "Children"
msgstr "Deca"

#: privacy
msgid "The app collects no personal data, including from children."
msgstr "Aplikacija ne prikuplja nikakve lične podatke, pa ni od dece."

#: privacy
msgid "Changes and contact"
msgstr "Promene i kontakt"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Changes will be published on this page. Questions: <a href=\"mailto:swajp.keyboard@gmail.com\">swajp.keyboard@gmail.com</a>"
msgstr ""
"Promene će biti objavljene na ovoj stranici. Pitanja: <a href=\"mailto:swajp.keyboard@gmail.com\">swajp.keyboard@gmail.com</a>"

#: privacy
msgid "Developer: Aleš Brunner, Czech Republic"
msgstr "Programer: Aleš Brunner, Češka"

